        <p>Pick a catalog card to place a new ghost. On the ground, one click selects for properties and collider editing; double-click or hold takes the asset into a movable ghost, then click to place it. Tap R for 90°, or hold R and drag horizontally for precise 15° steps. Fences and rails snap at 15° increments and can branch from an existing span.</p>
